{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "71006217-f6ab-81b9-a121-dd16a8d589d1",
  "created_at": "2026-02-26T12:39:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ileana Valdez",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T12:38:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T12:38:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I call about the sidewalk. It is broken, heaved up, and I tripped on it yesterday. Almost fell down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T12:38:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry to hear that. Are you okay? Where's the sidewalk, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T12:38:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am okay, only my knee is sore. It is 170 Mill Street. One-seven-zero, Mill Street. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T12:38:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 170 Mill Street, got it. And the sidewalk's lifted up, like a slab pushed up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T12:38:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the slab go up, maybe [line breaks up] maybe two inches higher. And it is right in the bike lane, so the bicycle people also can hit it. Is dangerous."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T12:39:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out for a second. Two inches, in the bike lane, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T12:39:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, two inches. Bike lane. I want the street to be added to the repair list. This is not first time I notice it. Nobody fix."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T12:39:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put 170 Mill Street on the list for the sidewalk crew to look at. Can I get a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T12:39:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0178. Zero-one-seven-eight. Sorry, I am a little rushed voice. I just finish arguing with my teenager about curfew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T12:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, I hear you. Okay, I've got it all noted. Heaved sidewalk, bike lane, 170 Mill. Someone will take a look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T12:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please do soon."
    }
  ],
